#indent 4

//: # ty/memo_trait_proof_reader
//: `.neplproof` artifact bytes から typed header、record table、serialized sidecar index table を[読/よ]む reader 前段です。
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - `.neplproof` の永続 bytes を、proof store や decoded artifact owner へ渡す前に fail-closed に分類します。
//: - この module は artifact bytes の magic word、header word、fixed-width record word を読み、既存の `memo_trait_proof_artifact.nepl` validator へ接続します。
//: - little-endian word decode は `memo_trait_artifact_word_codec.nepl` の共有 contract を使い、canonical key payload codec と同じ 31-bit nonnegative word 規則を使います。
//: - record table から復元した typed record は、互換 path では `memo_trait_proof_decoded.nepl` の generated sorted sidecar index へ渡し、serialized-index path では bytes から読んだ sidecar index table と一緒に decoded artifact owner へ渡します。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_header_result` は header prefix だけを読みます。record / index / canonical payload bytes は読みません。
//: - magic word が違う場合は `MagicMismatch` として拒否し、artifact schema validator へ進めません。
//: - word decode error は `WordReadInvalid(kind)` として保持します。short header と high-bit word を schema mismatch へ混ぜません。
//: - header word が読めた後は、必ず `selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_header_result` を通し、artifact schema、canonical payload schema、policy schema、record/index count を既存 authority で検査します。
//: - `selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_decoded_artifact_from_record_bytes_result` は header の `record_count` 件だけを読む互換 API です。serialized index table は読まず、decoded artifact 側が record table から sorted sidecar index を生成します。
//: - `selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_decoded_artifact_from_indexed_record_bytes_result` は record table の直後に続く `index_count` 件の serialized sidecar index table を読み、record / index の対応と sorted order を decoded artifact 境界で再検査します。
//: - record body の enum tag は、数値のまま上位へ流さず、この module で typed enum へ戻します。未知 tag、`Ok` result に残った reject payload、field range 不整合、過大 record count は fail-closed にします。
//: - decoded artifact reader は proof acceptance authority ではありません。index hit、record payload hash、fingerprint hit のいずれかだけで proof を受理してはいけません。canonical payload decode、payload hash 再計算、policy、proof kind、proof store preseed / producer gate は後続境界で検査します。
//: - source text、span、path suffix、display name、diagnostic text、lexeme、session-local `SelfhostTypeId` は header reader の authority ではありません。
//:
//: [現状/げんじょう]:
//: - この slice は header reader、record-only decoded artifact reader、serialized index table reader です。canonical payload bytes table は payload reader extension が扱い、persistent stable map、proof store preseed は後続 slice で接続します。
//: - header prefix reader は trailing bytes を拒否しません。完全な `.neplproof` reader は、この header の `record_count` / `index_count` を使って record table と index table の終端を別途検査します。
//: - record-only decoded artifact reader は、現 slice の fixed-width record table の終端を検査して trailing bytes を拒否します。将来 serialized index table を同じ byte stream に追加するときは、別 API と schema 境界で index section を読むようにします。
//: - serialized-index decoded artifact reader は header、record table、index table の終端を検査し、payload section は読まないため trailing payload bytes を拒否します。payload section 付き artifact は `memo_trait_proof_payload_reader.nepl` が indexed prefix の後ろから読みます。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]:
//: - header decode は固定 6 word だけを読むため O(1) です。
//: - record table decode は record 数 n と fixed word width w に対して O(n * w) です。w は現 schema では固定なので O(n) です。
//: - serialized index table decode は index 数 m と fixed word width 4 に対して O(m) です。
//: - decoded artifact construction は generated sorted sidecar index producer の現実装に従い O(n^2) です。これは proof acceptance ではなく、後続 lookup narrowing のための temporary sidecar です。
//: - FileSystem、module graph、source scan、proof store lookup は行いません。
//:
//: neplg2:test[stdio, normalize_newlines]
//: stdout: mlstr:
//: ##: Checked [ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok]
//: ##: [0] ok
//: ##: [1] ok
//: ##: [2] ok
//: ##: [3] ok
//: ##: [4] ok
//: ##: [5] ok
//: ##: [6] ok
//: ##: [7] ok
//: exit_code: 0
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target std
//:| #import "core/result" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_artifact_word_codec" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_proof_artifact" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_proof_reader" as *
//:| #import "std/test" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     let checks0 checks_new
//:     match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_stage0:
//:         Result::Ok summary:
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_header_result_is_ok summary.accepted_header
//:             let checks2 checks_push checks1 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.magic_mismatch) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::MagicMismatch
//:             let checks3 checks_push checks2 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.short_header) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::WordReadInvalid SelfhostMemoTraitArtifactWordReadErrorKind::UnexpectedEnd
//:             let checks4 checks_push checks3 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.schema_mismatch) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::HeaderInvalid SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofArtifactErrorKind::ArtifactSchemaMismatch
//:             let checks5 checks_push checks4 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_unit_result_is_ok summary.accepted_artifact
//:             let checks6 checks_push checks5 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.unknown_proof_kind) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::ProofKindTagInvalid
//:             let checks7 checks_push checks6 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.trailing_bytes) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::TrailingBytes
//:             let checks8 checks_push checks7 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.invalid_record) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::RecordInvalid SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofArtifactErrorKind::RecordPayloadHashPlaceholder
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks8
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//:         Result::Err _e:
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 Result::Err "neplproof reader stage0 setup failed"
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks1
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//: ```

#import "alloc/collections/vec" as v
#import "core/field" as field
#import "core/math" as *
#import "core/result" as *
#import "core/traits/copy" as *
#import "./memo_trait" as *
#import "./memo_trait_artifact_word_codec" as *
#import "./memo_trait_canonical_key_payload" as *
#import "./memo_trait_policy" as *
#import "./memo_trait_proof_artifact" as *
#import "./memo_trait_proof_decoded" as *
#import "./memo_trait_proof_store" as *
#import "./memo_trait_producer" as *

//: SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind: `.neplproof` header reader の拒否理由
//:
//: [分類/ぶんるい]:
//: - `MagicMismatch`: bytes の先頭 word が `.neplproof` magic ではありません。
//: - `WordReadInvalid(kind)`: header word を読む段階で short input または unsupported high-bit word が見つかりました。
//: - `HeaderInvalid(kind)`: word は読めたが、artifact header schema / count validator が拒否しました。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind:
    MagicMismatch
    WordReadInvalid %SelfhostMemoTraitArtifactWordReadErrorKind
    HeaderInvalid %SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofArtifactErrorKind
    RecordCountLimitExceeded
    IndexCountLimitExceeded
    IndexCountUnsupported
    TrailingBytes
    SourceKindTagInvalid
    ProofKindTagInvalid
    FieldEvidenceTagInvalid
    FieldEvidencePayloadInvalid
    ProofStatusTagInvalid
    HazardTagInvalid
    ResultTagInvalid
    ResultPayloadInvalid
    RejectKindTagInvalid
    RecordInvalid %SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofArtifactErrorKind
    RecordPushInvalid %StdErrorKind
    IndexEntryInvalid %SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofArtifactErrorKind
    IndexPushInvalid %StdErrorKind
    DecodedArtifactInvalid %SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofDecodedArtifactErrorKind

//: SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderStage0Summary: header reader の代表 smoke
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderStage0Summary:
    accepted_header %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofHeader SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind
    magic_mismatch %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofHeader SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind
    short_header %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofHeader SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind
    schema_mismatch %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofHeader SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind
    accepted_artifact %Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind
    unknown_proof_kind %Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind
    trailing_bytes %Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind
    invalid_record %Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderStage0Summary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderStage0Summary \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderStage0Summary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderStage0Summary \self:
        self

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_magic: `.neplproof` artifact header の magic word
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - canonical key payload codec の magic とは別 namespace です。別 payload を `.neplproof` 全体として誤読しないため、reader は schema word より先にこの値を確認します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_magic %fn void i32 \void:
    792013

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_header_words: `.neplproof` header prefix の word 数
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_header_words %fn void i32 \void:
    6

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_words: Phase 1 record body の word 数
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - この幅は artifact schema version 1 の固定 record body 幅です。
//: - canonical payload bytes table と serialized index table はこの幅に含めません。
//:
//: [word layout]:
//: - `0`: canonical payload schema version。
//: - `1`: canonical fingerprint schema version。
//: - `2`: canonical fingerprint root hash。
//: - `3`: serialized canonical payload hash。
//: - `4..11`: `MemoKey` / `MemoValue` source identity。順に key kind、key module、key symbol、key signature、value kind、value module、value symbol、value signature です。
//: - `12..16`: solver policy。順に rule schema、solver version、primitive rule hash、aggregate rule hash、hazard rule hash です。
//: - `17`: stored proof kind tag。
//: - `18..20`: aggregate field evidence。順に tag、first field、field count です。
//: - `21..24`: Copy / Drop / Eq / Hash proof status tag。
//: - `25`: hazard evidence tag。
//: - `26..29`: key/value result。順に key result tag、key result payload、value result tag、value result payload です。
//: - `30`: record payload hash。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_words %fn void i32 \void:
    31

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_words: serialized sidecar index entry の word 数
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - この幅は artifact schema version 1 の fixed sidecar index entry 幅です。
//: - index entry は canonical fingerprint、record ordinal、record payload hash だけを持つ narrowing payload です。proof payload、policy、canonical payload hash は record table 側に残します。
//:
//: [word layout]:
//: - `0`: canonical fingerprint schema version。
//: - `1`: canonical fingerprint root hash。
//: - `2`: record ordinal。
//: - `3`: record payload hash。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_words %fn void i32 \void:
    4

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_count_limit: reader が一度に読む record 件数上限
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - header の `record_count` は artifact の外部入力なので、schema 上非負であっても無制限に allocation へ進めません。
//: - この上限は artifact bytes の失敗時挙動を安定させるための入力サイズ境界です。source text の体裁や説明量を制約するものではありません。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_count_limit %fn void i32 \void:
    16384

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_count_limit: reader が一度に読む index entry 件数上限
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - index table も artifact の外部入力なので、record count と同じく allocation 前に上限を確認します。
//: - この上限は artifact reader の入力サイズ境界であり、source file の行数や doc comment の長さを制限するものではありません。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_count_limit %fn void i32 \void:
    16384

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_expected_record_only_words: record-only reader が消費する word 数
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_expected_record_only_words %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofHeader i32 \header:
    add selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_header_words mul header.record_count selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_words

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_expected_indexed_words: header、record table、serialized index table の word 数を[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_expected_indexed_words %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofHeader i32 \header:
    add selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_expected_record_only_words header mul header.index_count selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_words

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_indexed_prefix_byte_count_result: indexed prefix の byte 数を上限検査込みで[返/かえ]す
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - payload reader が serialized index table 付き prefix を複写する前に、record / index 件数の入力サイズ境界を reader と同じ規則で確認します。
//: - この関数は bytes owner を作らず、record table や index table も読みません。外部入力 header から必要な prefix byte 数だけを、allocation 前の preflight として返します。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `record_count` が reader 上限を越えた場合は `RecordCountLimitExceeded` を返します。
//: - `index_count` が reader 上限を越えた場合は `IndexCountLimitExceeded` を返します。
//: - 成功時の byte count は header、fixed-width record table、serialized sidecar index table の合計だけを表します。canonical payload section は含めません。
//: - この入力サイズ境界は artifact bytes の処理量を抑えるためのものであり、source file の行数や doc comment の長さを制限するものではありません。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_indexed_prefix_byte_count_result %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofHeader Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \header:
    if:
        gt header.record_count selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_count_limit
        then:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::RecordCountLimitExceeded
        else:
            if:
                gt header.index_count selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_count_limit
                then:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::IndexCountLimitExceeded
                else:
                    Result::Ok mul selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_expected_indexed_words header 4

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_word_index: record ordinal と field ordinal から word index を[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_word_index %fn i32 fn i32 i32 \record_ordinal\field_ordinal:
    add selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_header_words add mul record_ordinal selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_words field_ordinal

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_word_index: index ordinal と field ordinal から word index を[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_word_index %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofHeader fn i32 fn i32 i32 \header\index_ordinal\field_ordinal:
    add selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_expected_record_only_words header add mul index_ordinal selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_words field_ordinal

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_word_result: record table の word を[読/よ]む
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_word_result %fn &Vec u8 fn i32 fn i32 Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \bytes\record_ordinal\field_ordinal:
    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_word_result bytes selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_word_index record_ordinal field_ordinal

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_word_result: serialized index table の word を[読/よ]む
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_word_result %fn &Vec u8 fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofHeader fn i32 fn i32 Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \bytes\header\index_ordinal\field_ordinal:
    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_word_result bytes selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_index_word_index header index_ordinal field_ordinal

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_source_kind_result: source kind tag を typed enum へ[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_source_kind_result %fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitSourceKind SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \tag:
    if:
        eq tag 1
        then:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitSourceKind::MemoKeyTrait
        else:
            if:
                eq tag 2
                then:
                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitSourceKind::MemoValueTrait
                else:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::SourceKindTagInvalid

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_source_identity_result: source identity fields を typed payload へ[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_source_identity_result %fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitSourceIdentity SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \kind_tag\module_hash\symbol_hash\signature_hash:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_source_kind_result kind_tag:
        Result::Ok kind:
            Result::Ok selfhost_memo_trait_source_identity_new kind module_hash symbol_hash signature_hash
        Result::Err e:
            Result::Err e

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_proof_kind_result: stored proof kind tag を typed enum へ[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_proof_kind_result %fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitStoredProofKind SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \tag:
    if:
        eq tag 1
        then:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitStoredProofKind::KeyAndValue
        else:
            if:
                eq tag 2
                then:
                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitStoredProofKind::KeyOnlyUnsupported
                else:
                    if:
                        eq tag 3
                        then:
                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitStoredProofKind::ValueOnlyUnsupported
                        else:
                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::ProofKindTagInvalid

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_field_evidence_result: aggregate field evidence tag を typed enum へ[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_field_evidence_result %fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateFieldEvidence SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \tag\first_field\field_count:
    if:
        eq tag 1
        then:
            let range %SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateFieldRange selfhost_memo_trait_aggregate_field_range_new first_field field_count
            if:
                selfhost_memo_trait_aggregate_field_range_is_valid range
                then:
                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateFieldEvidence::Known range
                else:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::FieldEvidencePayloadInvalid
        else:
            if:
                or ne first_field 0 ne field_count 0
                then:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::FieldEvidencePayloadInvalid
                else:
                    if:
                        eq tag 2
                        then:
                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateFieldEvidence::MissingLayout
                        else:
                            if:
                                eq tag 3
                                then:
                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateFieldEvidence::GenericArgumentUnsubstituted
                                else:
                                    if:
                                        eq tag 4
                                        then:
                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateFieldEvidence::CycleLimitReached
                                        else:
                                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::FieldEvidenceTagInvalid

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_proof_status_result: proof status tag を typed enum へ[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_proof_status_result %fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \tag:
    if:
        eq tag 1
        then:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus::Proven
        else:
            if:
                eq tag 2
                then:
                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus::Missing
                else:
                    if:
                        eq tag 3
                        then:
                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus::Impure
                        else:
                            if:
                                eq tag 4
                                then:
                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus::Unknown
                                else:
                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::ProofStatusTagInvalid

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_hazard_result: hazard tag を typed enum へ[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_hazard_result %fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateHazardEvidence SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \tag:
    if:
        eq tag 1
        then:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateHazardEvidence::NoHazard
        else:
            if:
                eq tag 2
                then:
                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateHazardEvidence::CacheReferenceEscape
                else:
                    if:
                        eq tag 3
                        then:
                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateHazardEvidence::ExternalHandle
                        else:
                            if:
                                eq tag 4
                                then:
                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateHazardEvidence::OwnerToken
                                else:
                                    if:
                                        eq tag 5
                                        then:
                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateHazardEvidence::PublicMutableState
                                        else:
                                            if:
                                                eq tag 6
                                                then:
                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateHazardEvidence::Unknown
                                                else:
                                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::HazardTagInvalid

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_reject_kind_result: MemoKey / MemoValue reject tag を typed enum へ[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_reject_kind_result %fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \tag:
    if:
        eq tag 1
        then:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::MissingTypeRecord
        else:
            if:
                eq tag 2
                then:
                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::ErrorTypeUnsupported
                else:
                    if:
                        eq tag 3
                        then:
                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::I64Unsupported
                        else:
                            if:
                                eq tag 4
                                then:
                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::F32KeyUnsupported
                                else:
                                    if:
                                        eq tag 5
                                        then:
                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::F64Unsupported
                                        else:
                                            if:
                                                eq tag 6
                                                then:
                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::StrUnsupported
                                                else:
                                                    if:
                                                        eq tag 7
                                                        then:
                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::NeverUnsupported
                                                        else:
                                                            if:
                                                                eq tag 8
                                                                then:
                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::FunctionUnsupported
                                                                else:
                                                                    if:
                                                                        eq tag 9
                                                                        then:
                                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::NamedLayoutUnknown
                                                                        else:
                                                                            if:
                                                                                eq tag 10
                                                                                then:
                                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::AppliedLayoutUnknown
                                                                                else:
                                                                                    if:
                                                                                        eq tag 11
                                                                                        then:
                                                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::ParameterUnresolved
                                                                                        else:
                                                                                            if:
                                                                                                eq tag 12
                                                                                                then:
                                                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::CopyProofMissing
                                                                                                else:
                                                                                                    if:
                                                                                                        eq tag 13
                                                                                                        then:
                                                                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::CopyProofImpure
                                                                                                        else:
                                                                                                            if:
                                                                                                                eq tag 14
                                                                                                                then:
                                                                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::CopyProofUnknown
                                                                                                                else:
                                                                                                                    if:
                                                                                                                        eq tag 15
                                                                                                                        then:
                                                                                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::DropProofMissing
                                                                                                                        else:
                                                                                                                            if:
                                                                                                                                eq tag 16
                                                                                                                                then:
                                                                                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::DropProofImpure
                                                                                                                                else:
                                                                                                                                    if:
                                                                                                                                        eq tag 17
                                                                                                                                        then:
                                                                                                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::DropProofUnknown
                                                                                                                                        else:
                                                                                                                                            if:
                                                                                                                                                eq tag 18
                                                                                                                                                then:
                                                                                                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::EqProofMissing
                                                                                                                                                else:
                                                                                                                                                    if:
                                                                                                                                                        eq tag 19
                                                                                                                                                        then:
                                                                                                                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::EqProofImpure
                                                                                                                                                        else:
                                                                                                                                                            if:
                                                                                                                                                                eq tag 20
                                                                                                                                                                then:
                                                                                                                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::EqProofUnknown
                                                                                                                                                                else:
                                                                                                                                                                    if:
                                                                                                                                                                        eq tag 21
                                                                                                                                                                        then:
                                                                                                                                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::HashProofMissing
                                                                                                                                                                        else:
                                                                                                                                                                            if:
                                                                                                                                                                                eq tag 22
                                                                                                                                                                                then:
                                                                                                                                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::HashProofImpure
                                                                                                                                                                                else:
                                                                                                                                                                                    if:
                                                                                                                                                                                        eq tag 23
                                                                                                                                                                                        then:
                                                                                                                                                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::HashProofUnknown
                                                                                                                                                                                        else:
                                                                                                                                                                                            if:
                                                                                                                                                                                                eq tag 24
                                                                                                                                                                                                then:
                                                                                                                                                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::CacheReferenceEscape
                                                                                                                                                                                                else:
                                                                                                                                                                                                    if:
                                                                                                                                                                                                        eq tag 25
                                                                                                                                                                                                        then:
                                                                                                                                                                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::ExternalHandle
                                                                                                                                                                                                        else:
                                                                                                                                                                                                            if:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                eq tag 26
                                                                                                                                                                                                                then:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::OwnerToken
                                                                                                                                                                                                                else:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                    if:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                        eq tag 27
                                                                                                                                                                                                                        then:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::PublicMutableState
                                                                                                                                                                                                                        else:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                            if:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                eq tag 28
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                then:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind::HazardUnknown
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                else:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::RejectKindTagInvalid

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_memo_result_result: Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind tag を typed payload へ[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_memo_result_result %fn i32 fn i32 Result Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitRejectKind SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \tag\payload:
    if:
        eq tag 1
        then:
            if:
                eq payload 0
                then:
                    Result::Ok Result::Ok unit
                else:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::ResultPayloadInvalid
        else:
            if:
                eq tag 2
                then:
                    match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_reject_kind_result payload:
                        Result::Ok reject:
                            Result::Ok Result::Err reject
                        Result::Err e:
                            Result::Err e
                else:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind::ResultTagInvalid

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_policy_from_words_result: record 内の policy word 群を typed policy へ[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_policy_from_words_result %fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitProofStorePolicy SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \key_kind\key_module\key_symbol\key_signature\value_kind\value_module\value_symbol\value_signature\rule_schema\solver_version\primitive_rule_hash\aggregate_rule_hash\hazard_rule_hash:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_source_identity_result key_kind key_module key_symbol key_signature:
