//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_proof_from_words_result: word vector から stored proof payload を[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_reader_record_proof_from_words_result %fn &Vec i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitStoredAggregateProof SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofReaderErrorKind \words:
